-- title:
--   A version is committed in at most one term, and committed versions increase with the term
-- statement:
--   For every payload type `V`, cluster parameters `P` with `P.InitCompatible` and `P.strategy = ElectionStrategy.DEFAULT_INSTANCE`, every cluster `W` with `Reachable P W`, and all keys with `Committed W t₁ v₁` and `Committed W t₂ v₂`: `(v₁ = v₂ → t₁ = t₂) ∧ (t₁ < t₂ → v₁ < v₂)`. Two committed publications with the same version have the same term, hence (by `one_state_per_version`) the same cluster state.
